<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><title>环境检测 - 森码云</title>
<style>body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0F172A,#1E293B);min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:40px 20px;color:#fff}.c{max-width:600px;width:100%}.card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:24px;padding:48px;backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}.h{text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px}.h svg{width:64px;height:64px;margin:0 auto 20px}.h h1{font-size:28px;font-weight:700}.h p{font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)}.steps{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:40px}.step{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px}.step .d{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563EB,#7C3AED);color:#fff}.step .n{font-size:12px;color:#fff}.env{margin-bottom:24px}.env-item{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:8px}.env-item.ok{border-color:rgba(16,185,129,.3)}.env-item .ok{color:#10B981;font-weight:600}.env-item .err{color:#EF4444;font-weight:600}.btn{width:100%;padding:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563EB,#7C3AED);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(37,99,235,.3)}</style></head>
<body><div class="c"><div class="card"><div class="h"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><rect width="40" height="40" rx="8" fill="url(#g)"/><path d="M20 10c-5.5 0-10 4.5-10 10s4.5 10 10 10 10-4.5 10-10-4.5-10-10-10zm0 18c-4.4 0-8-3.6-8-8s3.6-8 8-8 8 3.6 8 8-3.6 8-8 8z" fill="white"/><defs><linearGradient id="g"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#2563EB"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#7C3AED"/></linearGradient></defs></svg><h1>安装向导</h1><p>森码云实人认证系统 v1.0.0</p></div>
<div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="d">1</div><span class="n">环境检测</span></div><div class="step"><div class="d">2</div><span class="n">数据库</span></div><div class="step"><div class="d">3</div><span class="n">管理员</span></div><div class="step"><div class="d">4</div><span class="n">完成</span></div></div>
<div class="env"><div class="env-item ok"><span>PHP版本 (>=8.1)</span><span class="ok"><?=PHP_VERSION?></span></div><div class="env-item ok"><span>PDO扩展</span><span class="ok">通过</span></div><div class="env-item ok"><span>GD扩展</span><span class="ok">通过</span></div><div class="env-item ok"><span>cURL扩展</span><span class="ok">通过</span></div></div>
<button class="btn" onclick="location.href='/install?step=2'">下一步</button></div></div></body></html>